      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "At every spin, a random feature can be won. Possible features are:\n\nFREE
    SPINS ROUND - a FREE SPINS ROUND is triggered and plays normally.\n\nJACKPOT
    BONUS GAME - in the BONUS GAME pick          reveal a JACKPOT symbol. Match\n\n3
    of the same symbols to be awarded the corresponding JACKPOT.\n\nThe CAISHEN RANDOM
    AWARD FEATURE is available during the FREE\_SPINS\_ROUND."
