  m_text: "Hit 3 SCATTER symbols to trigger the FREE SPINS FEATURE.\n\nAt the beginning
    of the FREE SPINS FEATURE choose one out of seven options.\n\nDuring the feature,
    at every spin, a multiplier value is randomly selected from a range chosen as
    part of the FREE SPINS OPTION.\n\nAt the end of every free spin, all winning
    combinations that contain at least one WILD symbol are multiplied by the randomly
    selected multiplier\_value."
