      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "High volatility games pay out less often on average but the chance to
    hit big wins in a short time span is higher.\n\nOnly the highest win is paid
    per winning combination on the same pay way.\nWhen winning on multiple pay ways,
    all wins are added to the total win.\n\nFree spins and bonus wins are added to
    the payline win.\nAll wins are multiplied by base bet.\nAll values are expressed
    as actual wins in coins.\n\nFree spins win is awarded to the player after the
    round completes.\nFree spins total win in the history contains the whole win
    of the cycle.\n\n\n\n\nThe maximum RTP of this game is 96.5%\nThe minimum RTP
    of this game is 95.94%\n\nMINIMUM BET: $0.18\nMAXIMUM BET: $144.00\n\nMalfunction
    voids all\_pays\_and\_plays."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
